safexcore
------------------------------------------
Reference implementation of Safex Blockchain in C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libboost_chrono1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_filesystem1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_program_options1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_regex1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_serialization1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_thread1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblmdb0-0.9.19-1
  libminiupnpc21-2.3.5-1bl1
  libpcsclite1-2.5.3-1bl1
  librandomx0-1.2.3-1bl1
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libunbound8-1.26.2-1
  libzmq5-4.3.5-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
