Canonical website:
  https://github.com/safex/safexcore

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/safex/safexcore.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack safexcore-7.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./safexcore-7.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/safexcore-7.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/safexcore-7.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(safexcore)
  /usr/bin/safex-blockchain-export.exe
  /usr/bin/safex-blockchain-import.exe
  /usr/bin/safex-blockchain-usage.exe
  /usr/bin/safex-wallet-cli.exe
  /usr/bin/safex-wallet-rpc.exe
  /usr/bin/safexd.exe
  /usr/include/wallet/api/wallet_api.h
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/safexcore.README
  /usr/share/doc/safexcore/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/safexcore/README.md

